[00:19.30]The clock stopped ticking forever ago
{"时钟早在永恒前就已停摆"}
[00:23.300]How long have I been up?
{"我清醒多久了？"}
[00:25.300]I don't know.
{"我不知道。"}
[00:26.300]I can't get a grip,
{"我无法掌控，"}
[00:28.300]But I can't let go
{"却也无法放手"}
[00:30.300]There wasn't anything
{"尽管根本没有什么"}
[00:31.300]To hold onto though...
{"能让我紧握不放……"}
[00:33.300]Why can't I see?
{"为何我眼中所见？"}
[00:35.300]Why can't I see?
{"为何我眼中所见？"}
[00:37.300]All the colors that you see?
{"与你所见色彩全然不同？"}
[00:40.300]Please, Can I be,
{"求求你，能否让我，"}
[00:42.300]Please, Can I be
{"求求你，能否让我"}
[00:44.300]Colorful and free?
{"也绚丽又自由？"}
[00:47.300]WHAT THE HELL'S GOING ON?!
{"这他妈到底怎么回事？！"}
[00:48.300]CAN SOMEONE TELL ME PLEASE--
{"谁能告诉我——"}
[00:50.300]WHY, I'M SWITCHING FASTER THAN THE CHANNELS ON TV!!
{"为何我切换得比电视频道还快！！"}
[00:53.300]I'M black, THEN I'M white!!
{"我忽而漆黑！！忽而苍白！！"}
[00:55.300]NO!!!
{"不！！！"}
[00:56.300]SOMETHING ISN'T RIGHT!!
{"这绝对不正常！！"}
[00:57.300]MY ENEMY'S INVISIBLE, I DON'T KNOW HOW TO FIGHT!!
{"看不见的敌人让我无从对抗！！"}
[01:01.300]THE TREMBLING FEAR IS MORE THAN I CAN TAKE,
{"战栗的恐惧已超出承受范围，"}
[01:04.300]WHEN I'M UP AGAINST
{"当我直面"}
[01:05.300]THE ECHO IN THE MIRROR!!
{"镜中的回声！！"}
[01:08.300]ECHO!!
{"回声！！"}
[01:14.300]
